flowchart TD
  A[Intern opens SALIGAN PWA] --> B{Online?}
  B -- Yes --> C[Load latest server records]
  B -- No --> D[Load local IndexedDB records]
  C --> E[Create or update DTR entry]
  D --> E
  E --> F[Write notes / attach evidence]
  F --> G[Save local draft]
  G --> H{Ready to sync?}
  H -- No --> I[Keep pending state]
  H -- Yes --> J[Submit sync operation]
  J --> K{Server validation passes?}
  K -- Yes --> L[Update canonical record]
  K -- No conflict --> M[Show validation errors]
  K -- Conflict --> N[Require merge/correction]
  L --> O[Generate DTR or report export]
